    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, your touch can mend wounds. As an action, you can touch a creature and restore a number of hit points equal to a roll of your Brawler die + your Wisdom modifier.</p>\n<p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, regaining all uses at the end of a short or long rest. If you have no more uses remaining, you can instead spend 1 spirit point to use the feature.</p>",
